234	// TestSourceCIDRFilterSlash31KeepsBothAddresses pins the two-address network:
235	// 192.0.2.3/31 admits both 192.0.2.2 and 192.0.2.3 — neither address is
236	// excluded as a network or broadcast address — while the immediate neighbors
237	// 192.0.2.1 and 192.0.2.4 are dropped. The same network spelled with its
238	// other host address selects identically.
